  message: "Measured while writing WI-zavot's PIN: taint's match rides on the in-tree FILE being named fs.js -- javascript:lib/migrations/util/fs.js:10-10:writeFile:variable is matched to fs.writeFile; the same alias in util/fs_util.js matches nothing (both consumers then agree, by both missing the write). test_io_taint_agreement.py::test_a_promisified_alias_is_answered_alike holds the fs.js shape as a strict xfail."  # 3936
